SECTION 5 — CONTRIBUTIONS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Contributions to this repository are warmly welcomed.

By submitting a pull request or patch, you agree that:

  5.1  Your contribution will be licensed under this same EOEL v1.0 license.

  5.2  You have the right to submit the code (it is your own original work
       or properly licensed third-party code).

  5.3  The Author (Ajinkya Chalke) retains the right to accept, reject, or
       modify any contribution.

  5.4  Contributors will be acknowledged in the project's contributor list
       unless they request otherwise.

