SECTION 6 — ENGINEERING SAFETY DISCLAIMER
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

THE ENGINEERING CALCULATORS, CIRCUIT SIMULATIONS, COMPLIANCE CHECKERS, AND
ALL TECHNICAL TOOLS WITHIN THIS SOFTWARE ARE PROVIDED FOR EDUCATIONAL AND
REFERENCE PURPOSES ONLY.

  ⚠  Results must NOT be used as the sole basis for any real-world electrical
     installation, design sign-off, or safety-critical decision.

  ⚠  Always verify calculations with a licensed Professional Engineer (PE)
     before implementation in any physical system.

  ⚠  The Author accepts no liability for any electrical failure, injury, or
     property damage resulting from reliance on this Software's outputs.

